// 九尾狐 on all fours, for the skinned-mesh spike. Not a Shiba in a fox
// coat: white by default with red markings (a fox spirit), big ears, a
// long narrow muzzle, cheek tufts flaring out, a fluffy chest ruff, a
// slimmer body on longer legs in dark stockings, red eyeliner, a flame on
// the forehead, a red cord with a bell, and nine tails rising behind in a
// bouquet, each three bones long so they swish one after another.
// The tails come from gen_tails.py: change them there and paste the
// output back in.
